<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Coelba auction draws 41 &quot;prequalifiers&quot;.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Coelba auction draws 41 &quot;prequalifiers&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>More than 4O companies have &quot;prequalified&quot; for the July 31 privatization auction of Brazil's Coelba, a power utility owned by Bahia state, according to a list published Friday by the Rio de Janeiro stock exchange.</p>
<p>Bahia state will sell 65.64 percent of Coelba's voting capital for a minimum price of 975.8 million reais ($903.5 million) at a closed-envelope auction on the Rio exchange.</p>
<p>An additional 5.5 percent voting stake will be offered to employees of Coelba, whose full name is Companhia de Eletricidade do Estado da Bahia.  </p>
<p>A total of 12 foreign companies are among the 41 concerns that have pre-qualified. They are:</p>
<p>* Bahia Participacoes Ltda</p>
<p>* Chilectra SA</p>
<p>* EDF International SA</p>
<p>* EDP Electricidade de Portugal SA</p>
<p>* Endesa Desarollo SA</p>
<p>* Enersis SA</p>
<p>* Estelmar Holding SA</p>
<p>* Fondelec Group Inc</p>
<p>* HIE-Brazil Inc  </p>
<p>* Brasilcap Capitalizacao SA</p>
<p>* Brasilprevi Previdencia Privada SA</p>
<p>* Brasilseg Seguradora do Brasil SA</p>
<p>* Brazilian Equity Partners</p>
<p>* CMS Brasil Energia Ltda</p>
<p>* Cerj</p>
<p>* EDP Brasil Ltda</p>
<p>* Escelsa</p>
<p>* FPL-I Brasil Participacoes SA</p>
<p>* Fundo Mutuo de Investimento BB Carteira Livre 1</p>
<p>* Guaraniana SA  </p>
<p>* HIE-Brasil Ltda</p>
<p>* Investco SA</p>
<p>* Lightenergy Ltda</p>
<p>* Light Servicos de Eletricidade SA</p>
<p>* Lightgas Ltda</p>
<p>* Opportunity Leste SA</p>
<p>* Planalto SA</p>
<p>* Previ Caixa de Previdencia</p>
<p>* Rail Pampas SA</p>
<p>* Sodepa Soc. Empreendimentos Publicos e Participacoes SA</p>
<p>* Sul Logistica SA</p>
<p>* Vale Brasil FDO Mutuo de Investimento em Acoes - CL</p>
<p>* Texpar Participacoes Ltda</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
